OL,3,AEngland's mayors to be given power to
OL,4,Aintroduce tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayors in England are to be given the
OL,7,Fpower to introduce an overnight visitor
OL,8,Flevy on tourists, under plans being
OL,9,Fannounced by the government later.
OL,11,FLocal leaders would be allowed to bring
OL,12,Fin an uncapped levy, dubbed a "tourist
OL,13,Ftax", as a percentage of the cost of
OL,14,Fhotels, bed and breakfasts and other
OL,15,Ftypes of accommodation rather than a
OL,16,Fflat fee.
OL,18,FHospitality leaders have warned "jobs
OL,19,Fare now at risk" because of the
OL,20,Fproposals and that families holidaying
OL,21,Fin England would feel the pinch.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
